@title PR1904: drill plan export, narrow enclosure, plate does not fit
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768
# A path allows one * (the harness folder), so the file name is spelled out. A second size reuses the folder and the toast says Replaced, so the check is the file name, not the verb. Synthetic enclosure SYN-narrow: Place all, accept, Export > Drill plan. The PDF is named with the article, so every enclosure keeps its own file.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-spec-narrow.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Cabinet
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot a-cabinet
click_text "Place all"
wait 40
shot b-placed
key Enter
wait 20
shot b2-accepted
click 1221 86
wait 6
click_text "Drill plan (hand, PDF)"
wait 3
shot c-exported
expect "SYN-narrow drill plan.pdf"
wait 10
expect_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/heat-place-all-synthetic +CAB1 SYN-narrow drill plan.pdf" 1500
keep_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/heat-place-all-synthetic +CAB1 SYN-narrow drill plan.pdf"
check_layout
